WEBVTT

NOTE
The missiles strike the newly mobile Balamb Garden.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Fire and shrapnel rake across the Garden's hull as a missile detonates.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.230
A huge blast erupts on the grassy field below.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.410
The Garden weathers the strike and pulls away.
